        "base": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/category/alerts/feed/",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_2\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>We&#8217;re conducting scheduled maintenance to the SmartZone Cloud Controller between 5 pm and 6 pm on 23rd July 2026.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No network outage:</strong> There will be no disruption to existing users who are already connected to the Wi-Fi or the SmartZone Cloud Controller, and all other classroom services will continue to operate as normal.</li>\n<li><strong>New Admin Connections:</strong> New ICT Admin users attempting to connect as Admin to the SmartZone Cloud Controller will be unable to do so for up to 20 minutes during the outage window.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you have any questions, our friendly Customer Support team is here to help. You can reach us on 0800 532 764 or support @n4l.co.nz.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/smartzone-cloud-controller-maintenance-23-july-2026/\">SmartZone Cloud Controller maintenance 23 July 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
      }
